. Write an equivalent fraction with denominator 6.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Figure", "accept": ["4/6"], "fig": {"kind": "pie", "labels": ["", "", ""], "values": [1, 1, 1], "shade": [0, 1]}}, {"id": "m4u11s1m10", "type": "num", "prompt": "Find the missing number: 2/3 = ☐/9", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "answer": 6, "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "tol": 0, "errs": [], "bare": true}, {"id": "m4u11s1m11", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which sign goes between 5/6 and 1/6?  5/6 ☐ 1/6", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "options": [{"t": ">", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "=", "ok": false, "fb": "Not quite – work through the method again."}, {"t": "<", "ok": false, "fb": "Not quite – work through the method again."}]}, {"id": "m4u11s1m12", "type": "short", "prompt": "Write 2/8 in its simplest form.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Knowledge", "accept": ["1/4"]}, {"id": "m4u11s1m13", "type": "match", "prompt": "Match the equivalent fractions.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Knowledge", "pairs": [{"l": "1/4", "r": "2/8"}, {"l": "1/5", "r": "2/10"}, {"l": "3/4", "r": "6/8"}, {"l": "1/2", "r": "4/8"}]}, {"id": "m4u11s1m14", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which is bigger, 3/8 or 3/4?", "diff": "H", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "options": [{"t": "3/4", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "3/8", "ok": false, "fb": "Not quite – work through the method again."}, {"t": "they are equal", "ok": false, "fb": "Not quite – work through the method again."}]}], "notes": "v3"}, {"id": "11.2", "title": "Percentages", "objs": ["O2"], "lesson": [{"k": "idea", "t": "What is a percentage?", "p": ["**Per cent** means **out of 100**. The sign is **%**.", "If 37 squares out of 100 are shaded, as on the grid shown, then **37%** is shaded. 100% is the whole thing."], "fig": {"kind": "waffle", "n": 37}}, {"k": "idea", "t": "Which percentages match which fractions?", "p": [], "table": {"head": ["Fraction", "Percentage"], "rows": [["1/2", "50%"], ["1/4", "25%"], ["3/4", "75%"], ["1/10", "10%"], ["1 whole", "100%"]]}}, {"k": "idea", "t": "How do I find 50% or 25% of an amount?", "p": ["50% is half, so **divide by 2**: 50% of 40 = 20.", "25% is a quarter, so **divide by 4**: 25% of 40 = 10."]}, {"k": "method", "t": "How do I find a percentage of an amount?", "p": ["Step 1: Change the percentage to a fraction (50% = 1/2, 25% = 1/4, 10% = 1/10).", "Step 2: Divide the amount by the bottom number.", "Step 3: Multiply by the top number if it is more than 1."]}, {"k": "example", "t": "Shaded", "p": [], "q": "73 out of 100 squares are white. What percentage is shaded?", "steps": [["100 − 73 = 27", ""]], "a": "27%"}, {"k": "example", "t": "Amount", "p": [], "q": "Find 75% of 20.", "steps": [["75% = 3/4", ""], ["20 ÷ 4 = 5; 5 × 3 = 15", ""]], "a": "15"}, {"k": "mistake", "t": "Percent is not 'out of 10'", "p": ["50% means 50 out of 100, not 5 out of 10 written strangely."]}, {"k": "tip", "t": "Learn the key facts", "p": ["50% = half, 25% = quarter, 10% = tenth. These solve most questions."]}], "video": {"src": null, "offset": 0, "dur": 300, "range": ""}, "stops": [{"id": "11.2-k2", "t": 2, "after": -1, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m4u11s2k02", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Before you read on: what is 50% of 30?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "options": [{"t": "15", "ok": true, "fb": "Correct."}, {"t": "50", "ok": false, "fb": "50% is half."}, {"t": "20", "ok": false, "fb": "Half of 30 is 15."}]}}, {"id": "11.2-k1", "t": 1, "after": 0, "review": [0, 0], "note": "", "q": {"id": "m4u11s2k01", "type": "num", "prompt": "What percentage is the same as 1/2?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "answer": 50, "unit": "%", "units": ["%"], "tol": 0, "errs": []}}], "captions": [], "chapters": [[0, 300]], "req": [{"id": "m4u11s2r01", "type": "num", "prompt": "What percentage of the 100 square is shaded?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Figure", "answer": 30, "unit": "%", "units